    "sections": {
        "description": "Editing Welcome Two is an elegant and versatile block theme, designed to let you build beautiful and accessible websites easily. It comes with a set of useful patterns, two style variations and a large color palette. The colors from the palette follow a certain naming scheme: A \"base\" color and a \"contrast\" color always have a contrast ratio of at least 7:1 whereas \"decorative\" colors do not meet that standard. As a block theme, Editing Welcome Two is fully compatible with the Site Editor and thus very easy to customize."
    },
